Package: covstructs7
Title: An S7 Framework for Constrained Matrix Parameters
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Giovanni", "Tinervia", , "giovannitinervia9@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Parametrisations of covariance-adjacent constrained matrix
    spaces as objects. A structure maps an unconstrained vector to a
    symmetric matrix -- positive definite, a correlation matrix, or a
    possibly rank-deficient precision -- and answers with exact first and
    second derivatives, the log-determinant or its pseudo-determinant
    counterpart, and the solves a likelihood needs. Numerical fallbacks make
    a user-defined structure work from its map alone, and a diagnostic
    verifies every component against an independent route.
